WEBVTT

00:06:28.160 --> 00:06:32.656
So I wrote this high school kid
back immediately

00:06:32.680 --> 00:06:34.336
and I said, "Yes, you are correct.

00:06:34.360 --> 00:06:36.856
I think I'll try to do that
this weekend. Thank you."

00:06:36.880 --> 00:06:38.256
So here's the video.

00:06:38.280 --> 00:06:39.776
So again, this is 2005.

00:06:39.800 --> 00:06:42.296
This is the Best Buy in New York City.

00:06:42.320 --> 00:06:45.096
We had about 80 people
show up to participate,

00:06:45.120 --> 00:06:46.416
entering one by one.

00:06:46.440 --> 00:06:48.917
There was an eight-year-old girl,
a 10-year-old girl.

00:06:48.941 --> 00:06:51.976
There was also a 65-year-old man
who participated.

00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:53.976
So a very diverse group of people.

00:06:54.000 --> 00:06:55.136
(Laughter)

00:06:55.160 --> 00:06:57.816
And I told people,
"Don't work. Don't actually do work.

00:06:57.840 --> 00:06:59.056
But also, don't shop.

00:06:59.080 --> 00:07:01.496
Just stand around
and don't face products."